{"name": "Virtual Perspective", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Virtual Perspective is a first-person puzzle game where you manipulate Power Cells using your perspective to solve spatial challenges.\u00a0Be wary of the purple\u00a0<strong>Kill Walls,\u00a0</strong>they can destroy Power Cells upon touching, forcing them to respawn where you found them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHIFT YOUR PERSPECTIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/c02e9928ece4c40638348cdae9711f42.poster.avif?t=1783543453\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/c02e9928ece4c40638348cdae9711f42.webm?t=1783543453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/c02e9928ece4c40638348cdae9711f42.mp4?t=1783543453\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VARIETY OF INTERACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/7e53febc665017ecd06b640cde6a1c2c.poster.avif?t=1783543453\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653230/extras/7e53febc665017ecd06b640cde6a1c2c.webm?t=1783543453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap